            "slug": "merfolk",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.ancestries.Item.FUqZRllwn6kmFA8K"
          },
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're a merfolk of the open seas. Your tail is patterned after the silvery tuna and herring that school by the million in your hunting grounds. Water obeys your will, and with a quick word, you can draw a sheathe of it around you. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shielding Wave] action.</p>"
